Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): preserve review handoffs across updater TERM
 receipts [daveey]

Recognize only exact same-run successful host-local TERM receipt pairs; preserve unmatched crashes, timeouts, SIGKILL and worker-lost evidence. Use shared requeue recognition in foreign-review and ordering fault scans. Proof: two predicate regressions RED then GREEN, ordering consumer RED then GREEN, 48 receipt controls pass. Read-only candidate replay clears original active_pr without editing live data. Broad consumer validation and independent review pending.
